flatcitybuf provides CMake targets:

    find_package(flatcitybuf CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE flatcitybuf::flatcitybuf)

Reading a local file:

    #include <fcb/reader.hpp>
    fcb::FcbReader reader = fcb::FcbReader::open_file("city.fcb");

Install flatcitybuf[curl] to enable the libcurl HTTP range-request reader:

    #include <fcb/http/curl_range_reader.hpp>
    auto reader = fcb::FcbReader::open(
        std::make_shared<fcb::CurlRangeReader>(url));
